<title>SYRIA: Syria signs $44.2 mln TV kit deal with Gold Star.</title>
<headline>Syria signs $44.2 mln TV kit deal with Gold Star.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syrian Arab Company for Electronic Industries (Syronics) signed with the South Korean company Gold Star a $44.2 million deal to buy 300,000 television kits, a company spokeswoman said on Monday.</p>
<p>She said the kits would be used to make 14-inch and 20-inch television sets.</p>
</text>
